    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it depends on implementation, but if you look at the actual data from places like france, the capital flight and lack of investment seems like a pretty settled fact. shouldn't we just focus on more proven methods instead of something that clearly backfires?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
